    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611240144)</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:01:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611240144</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
Shared workspaces: Settings › Subscription now shows the client's plan (no card details) with «Shared by <client>». A studio Admin can change the number of seats: Change shows the new price and the next invoice before Save. The card, invoices and Cancel stay the client's.

In a shared workspace, Settings hides Keys and the picture stays the client's.
]]></description>
