    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611232336)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:43:28 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611232336</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- **Add a Brand:** search finds hubs by words in any order («creator serge»), right as you type, and every hub shows its picture.
- **A new brand** shows its picture and its place in the list at once.
- **Move an account to a brand:** tap the Brand on an account's page, right-click an account and choose Move to Brand, or use Add an Account on a brand's page.
- **New accounts appear by themselves** a few seconds after you finish signing in in the browser, no need to switch workspaces.
]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/srgplus/srgplus-connect-macos/releases/latest/download/SRG-Plus-Connect.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="NwHpqybIPQmyH+yRXLvxmmjihkdEte68pKR/wx7i8n5OMmL2loxMQlwojVtLR06oKeuQEv7wEElsBV1IuM73CQ==" length="12146857" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611232325)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:35:41 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611232325</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
Shared workspaces: when a client shares an app with your studio as Admin, its workspace now appears in the workspace menu under «Shared by <client>». Open it to see its people and change the apps it shares.

Admins can now do what the Owner does in People: make someone an Admin, make an Admin a Member again, and change or remove another Admin. The Owner's own row stays the Owner's.
]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/srgplus/srgplus-connect-macos/releases/latest/download/SRG-Plus-Connect.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="/vu39jMx7b8BoIZ0Ee3iZ8eX7dO/3ucOCTl7xiJRu2Bk7XbeCl7qr6K5fEX67x1Fz3WmYi6tYRinBP1x4DIYDw==" length="12043017" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611230009)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:11:34 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611230009</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
Stripe for purchases: Connectors › Stripe · Purchases shows the Stripe accounts you connected, the latest purchases and what SRG+ CRM did with each. Connect Stripe, bring in earlier buyers, and see every event. Routines can now start on a Stripe purchase, refund, canceled subscription, failed payment or dispute.
]]></description>
