      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- Org Board: every post's panel now shows three blocks, each with «+»: Hat, Valuable final product and Statistics.
- Hat: attach a page from SRG+ (the hats of the agents on the post come first) or write a new one in your brand's Hats channel. An agent holding the post reads the same page before each run.
- Add a statistic: what it counts, the period, the quota, by hand or from an app.
- The post's product is changed right in the panel.
]]></description>
