      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
**Org Board**: how your company is run, in Connect.

- Divisions, departments and posts, who holds each post and who gives orders to whom.
- Put people and agents on posts (several can hold one), drag posts and people on the board.
- Products and statistics on the cards; a statistic's own page to write this week's number.
- Table and Full view, a PDF poster to print, and one branch in focus.
- Versions: publish the board with a note, restore an earlier one.
