    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611162348)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:52:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611162348</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
What's new since the last Mac download (0.1.4, November 5):

- Banks: connect your business bank accounts under Accounts, each with its own logo and colours, and check or remove them. Connecting, reconnecting or removing a bank asks for a code from your authenticator app first.
- Stripe: sign in to several Stripe accounts on the Stripe tile and see each one.
- Accounts: Social Accounts and Brands (connect an account, add a brand), Google Business Profile locations, and Partners under Users.
- Connectors: a "Shared with you" section and a table view. A member's Tools are listed by connector; click one to see its tools.
- Routines: pick SRG+ CRM events as a trigger in New Routine and Edit.
- History: Owners and Admins can clear the red mark on a finished run.
- Agents: an agent's page shows who can write, the models it can use and its highest reasoning level.
- Privacy Policy links in the app.
]]></description>
